{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-09-23 12:30:00', 'title': "MGM RESORTS & BETMGM NAMED OFFICIAL PARTNERS OF AMERICAN GAMING ASSOCIATION'S HAVE A GAME PLAN® MISSION", 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND BETMGM, THE JOINT VENTURE BETWEEN MGM RESORTS AND ENTAIN, ARE PROUD TO JOIN THE AMERICAN GAMING ASSOCIATION (AGA) AS OFFICIAL PARTNERS OF ITS HAVE A GAME PLAN ® MISSION.'}